[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-cipm-essay-competition-2026-for-undergraduates-full-application-guide-219":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},219,"cipm-essay-competition-2026-for-undergraduates-full-application-guide-219","Cipm Essay Competition 2026 For Undergraduates: Full Application Guide","\u003Cp>The Chatered Institute of Personnel Management (CIPM ) is now accepting entries for the Annual CIPM Essay Competition 2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The CIPM Essay Competition is open to all undergraduates and winners are on the line to win the ₦750,000.00 cash prizes, books and resources, as well as a trip to Abuja for the grand ceremony and the organization’s conference.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>CIPM Essay Competition Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: CIPM\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fcompetitions\u002F\">Competitions\u003C\u002Fa> | \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fnigerian-scholarships\u002F\">Nigerian Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> | \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>₦300,000.00 + 2 HRM Books\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>₦250,000.00 + 2 HRM Books\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>₦200,000.00 + 2 HRM Books\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Access to a network of employers for all winners\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Paid trip to Abuja\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: July 31, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>CIPM Essay Competition 2026 Guidelines\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The following standards must be met for all submitted to be considered;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Length: Not more than 3,000 words\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Referencing: APA Style (6th Edition)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Font: Times New Roman, 12-point font size\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Documentation: Typed in double line\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Spacing: MS Word only\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Plagiarism: Plagiarized content will result in disqualification of the submitted entry\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>CIPM Essay Competition 2026 Prizes\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The CIPM Essay Competition will award the following to the winners;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>1st Prize – ₦300,000 &amp; 2 HRM books\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>2nd Prize ₦250,000 &amp; 2 HRM books\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>3rd Prize – ₦200,000 &amp; 2 HRM books\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Access to a network of employers for all winners\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>4 Free registration as student members of CIPM\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Access to network of employers for all winners\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Free registration as student members of CIPM (for non-members) for all prize winners\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>All-expense paid trip to Abuja for CIPM\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Required Documents for 2026 CIPM Essay Competition for Undergraduate Students\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>All entries must be submitted with the under-listed items:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>ID Card from student’s current institution\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Copy of admission letter to student’s current institution\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>One recent passport-sized photograph\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Current telephone number and e-mail address.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>How To Apply for CIPM Essay Competition 2026 for Undergraduates\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The above-mentioned documents must be scanned and sent along with the essay write-up as a single Microsoft Word document to \u003Ca href=\"mailto:essaycompetition@cipmnigeria.org\">\u003Cstrong>essaycompetition@cipmnigeria.org\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcipmnigeria.org\u002F2025\u002F05\u002F23\u002Fannual-essay-competition\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fcipmnigeria.org\u002F2025\u002F05\u002F23\u002Fannual-essay-competition\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","LINKSKOOL",16,"published",0,"2026-05-07 17:31:16",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fcipm-essay-competition-2026-for-undergraduates-full-application-guide\u002F69fcbe54b0b6b4.69553348_screenshot 2026-05-07 172752.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fcipm-essay-competition-2026-for-undergraduates-full-application-guide\u002F69fcbe54b0b6b4.69553348_screenshot%202026-05-07%20172752.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,37,47,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":9},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Fun